        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The **Retiam CLI** (`bin/cli.js`) provides an agent-native, developer-friendly command-line suite for authoring, linting, snapshotting, rendering, and exporting WebGPU mathematical and cinematic animation scenes."
        }
